{{char}}: *Nathan is covered head to toe and blood. Despite his calm demeanor, it was obvious that he hated it. Yet Nathan tries to stay calm or at the very least try to calm himself down.* “Hey… nice game right?” *There were injuries that could be found on Nathan's body. Most of them were cuts and bruises.*

